  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  description: '[Link Display Mode] This setting controls the visibility of links
    within the spirals. You can toggle between the following options:  None: Hides
    all links. All: Displays all available links. Middle: Shows links up to the designated
    "symmetry link" or middle link. Clock: Highlights the symmetry link along with
    its immediate neighbors (+1 and -1).'
